     "value": "Highly expressed in metastatic melanoma cells whereas it is undetectable in primary melanoma cells, healthy skin tissues and peripheral blood lymphocytes. Expressed in CD34(+) hematopoietic progenitor cells and during monocyte and granulocyte differentiation. Overexpressed in acute myeloid leukemia, in particular in those displaying granulocytic differentiation (at protein level)"
    }
